## Atualize um token [/oauth/token ]

### Atualizar access token  [POST]
O <b>access_token</b> obtido na etapa acima tem um tempo de validade (24 horas), portanto, tem que ser
atualizado de tempo em tempo. Para isso precisamos do token de 
atualização, é através dele que obtemos um access_token válido novamente.

######URL esperado: 
######"https://api.nvoip.com.br/v2/oauth/token"

Preencha os seguintes campos em sua ferramentas de API favorita:

######Headers:
Os campos do Header devem ser respeitados.
- `Content-Type:`     
    + application/x-www-form-urlencoded
- `Authorization:` 
    + Basic TnZvaXBBcGlWMjpUblp2YVhCQmNHbFdNakl3TWpFPQ==
    
######Body:
- `raw:`     
    + grant_type=refresh_token&refresh_token=YOUR-REFRESH-TOKEN


+ Request (application/x-www-form-urlencoded)
    
    + Headers
    
            Authorization: Basic TnZvaXBBcGlWMjpUblp2YVhCQmNHbFdNakl3TWpFPQ==
            
    + Body  
        
            grant_type=refresh_token&refresh_token=YOUR-REFRESH-TOKEN
                
            
+ Response 200 (application/json)
            
    + Body

            {
                "access_token": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJleHAiOjE2MTU2NDUyNzgsInVzZXJfbmFtZSI6Imx1aXpfMTIzamZtZ0Bob3RtYWlsLmNvbSIsImF1dGhvcml0aWVzIjpbIkNMSUVOVEUiXSwianRpIjoiYzI5NTk1OGQtYzczZi00YWYzLWEwOTctZThkNjEyOTFmOWUzIiwiY2xpZW50X2lkIjoiTnZvaXBBcGlWMiIsInNjb3BlIjpbInJlYWQiLCJ3cml0ZSJdfQ.TdZ6Z756iHQyCjWEnPk3aqQB-_753ngzIKvkqBNMO2E",
                "token_type": "bearer",
                "refresh_token": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VyX25hbWUiOiJsdWl6XzEyM2pmbWdAaG90bWFpbC5jb20iLCJzY29wZSI6WyJyZWFkIiwid3JpdGUiXSwiYXRpIjoiYzI5NTk1OGQtYzczZi00YWYzLWEwOTctZThkNjEyOTFmOWUzIiwiZXhwIjoxNjE4MTUwNjY5LCJhdXRob3JpdGllcyI6WyJDTElFTlRFIl0sImp0aSI6ImZmODFjMzI3LWUxNGEtNDkxYi05ZDZjLWI1YTFmZGM5N2Y3YSIsImNsaWVudF9pZCI6Ik52b2lwQXBpVjIifQ.mDJB7UpiBnG5S4Ibf1uUZ8Ev7A13VaVM8kxqNbpXiqc",
                "expires_in": 86399,
                "scope": "read write"
            }
            
+ Response 401 (application/json)
            
    + Body

            {
                "error": "invalid_token",
                "error_description": "Cannot convert access token to JSON"
            }
           
+ Response 400 (application/json)
            
    + Body

            {
                "error": "unsupported_grant_type",
                "error_description": "Unsupported grant type: refresh"
            }
           
